---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <div
        data-home-lang="zh"
        class="flex flex-col items-center w-full dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors text-left"
    >
        <div
            class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 flex-wrap lg:text-xl md:text-lg w-full text-left dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors"
        >
            Hi! This is SmokingPuddle58, a graduate from Dept. of Mathematics of
            HKUST, and also a staff of HKUST.
            <br /><br />
            This is my personal blog page, and I try not make this page too technical.
            Work is already tiring, so why write too many regarding programming?
            <br /><br />
            So in this blog, I will put some personal things, probably something related
            to daily life, and in some cases, technical things that is used as a reminder
            and might help some other peoples.
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-horizontal gap-2 flex-wrap container"></div>
        <div
            class="rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200 p-5 w-full m-5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors"
        >
            <span id="description" class="lg:text-xl md:text-lg">Fun Facts</span
            >
            <div class="lg:text-lg md:text-md">
                1. The name "SmokingPuddle58" comes from the Xbox default
                username. Which now I also uses for Minecraft.
                <br>
                2. 
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
